     peared in N:M Threading Library (libkse, -lkse) in FreeBSD 5.2, and in
     1:1 Threading Library (libthr, -lthr) in FreeBSD 5.3.  Support for
     process-shared spinlocks appeared in FreeBSD 11.0.

